ere runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, July to August came in at 64% of normal and August to September at 60% on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 25996 hit 60% of normal that year.</p>"}
